    ic triage                                # Overview of what's ready to triage
    ic why odh-spark-operator-v3-4           # Why is it failing?
    ic analyze odh-spark-operator-v3-4       # Deep analysis with timeline
    ic errors odh-spark-operator-v3-4        # Extract just the errors

${BOLD}BACKWARD COMPATIBILITY:${NC}

  Old commands still work:
